# by ONE pixel, which is invisible but shifts every glyph: checkpoints 6, 7 and
# 8 went to rmse 0.052 / 0.132 / 0.033 against references that were captured
# without it, and block 9's Ctrl+End cleared it. Block 5 ends on Ctrl+Home, so
# repeating it here puts the view back exactly where the recording left it.
